WEBVTT

00:01:58.156 --> 00:02:00.867
And yet, in most immigration prisons

00:02:00.908 --> 00:02:05.621
that I have visited
as a lawyer or a researcher,

00:02:05.663 --> 00:02:10.585
the steel door is closed shut
with the clink of confinement.

00:02:11.002 --> 00:02:12.753
For the sake of votes,

00:02:12.753 --> 00:02:18.676
politicians claim people like Diego
and Wendy are dangerous, or dishonest.

00:02:18.676 --> 00:02:21.596
For the sake of profits,

00:02:21.596 --> 00:02:25.183
private corporations
run prisons to house them.

00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:29.353
It seems unimaginable today,

00:02:29.395 --> 00:02:32.857
but we haven't always locked up migrants